  unitName: Empusa
  unitId: 40171
  unitNumber: 275
  description: A demon girl wielding brass claws, she used to be of the same species
    as Lilin, but her love for precious metals and stones was too much and she ended
    up consuming so much she became a completely new species. She's an easier demon
    to control given her obedience when awarded jewelry, but since she refuses to
    give up any of said jewelry that comes into her possession she can become quite
    a formidable demon should someone have their eyes on her treasure. She also seems
    to have little if any interest in the opposite sex.
  summonDesc: I want gems!<br>I don't need a lot.<br>Gimme one?
  fusionDesc: If that's how it is then<br>I'll gladly fight alongside you!<br>Buy
    me something nice, OK?
